1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:40,350
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 3=

10
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:49,560
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

11
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,600
Here, Prince Jing.

12
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,200
Please give this a try.

13
00:00:52,350 --> 00:00:52,920
Try this.

14
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,240
Your Highness,

15
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:00,280
you must have been startled
when you arrived today.

16
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,200
I

17
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,320
would like to propose a toast
to you on my father's behalf.

18
00:01:05,590 --> 00:01:07,120
The Marquis has already
dealt with the matter,

19
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:09,590
so there's no need for you to worry.

20
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,280
I've had a bit too much to drink,

21
00:01:11,430 --> 00:01:12,840
so I'll head back to rest now.

22
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,400
Then...

23
00:01:13,510 --> 00:01:14,680
Just finish this cup.

24
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:15,920
Alright.

25
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,040
Take care, Your Highness.

26
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:18,790
Alright, please stay.

27
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:19,280
Take care.

28
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,200
Take care, Your Highness.

29
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,680
(With Xiao Yunting's
tolerance for alcohol,)

30
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,000
(there's no way
he'd get drunk so easily.)

31
00:01:31,790 --> 00:01:33,070
(What is he up to?)

32
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:03,230
(He clearly went into the study.)

33
00:02:04,350 --> 00:02:05,200
(Where is he?)

34
00:02:12,910 --> 00:02:15,280
(Why is Young Lady Qi)

35
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,680
(following me for no reason?)

36
00:02:25,340 --> 00:02:26,620
(Model Sayings)

37
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:30,960
Can you see clearly?

38
00:02:40,470 --> 00:02:42,000
What are you looking for, Your Highness?

39
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:45,910
I'll help you look.

40
00:02:46,910 --> 00:02:49,120
(He probably
didn't find anything, right?)

41
00:02:52,030 --> 00:02:53,240
I'm not good with alcohol.

42
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,190
I lost my way on the path back

43
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,560
and wandered in here by mistake.

44
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,520
How rude of me.

45
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:02,710
Not at all.

46
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:04,910
It is our lack of proper care.

47
00:03:05,470 --> 00:03:08,080
I would be honored to show you
the way back, Your Highness.

48
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:12,080
Why is the door
to the Marquis's study open?

49
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:12,910
This is a restricted area
in the residence.

50
00:03:12,910 --> 00:03:13,840
No one is allowed to trespass.

51
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:14,680
Go check it out quickly.

52
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:25,680
(He really is looking
for the account book.)

53
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:29,240
(The Qi family's survival
depends on this account book.)

54
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,400
(Prince Qi hasn't been
brought down yet,)

55
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:33,630
(so the Qi family's trump card
cannot be broken yet.)

56
00:03:34,750 --> 00:03:35,630
(Xiao Yunting,)

57
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,360
(I can't give you
the account book just yet.)

58
00:03:42,150 --> 00:03:43,800
The Marquis must have
forgotten to close the door.

59
00:03:44,030 --> 00:03:44,520
Let's go.

60
00:03:44,750 --> 00:03:45,240
Alright.

61
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:08,630
I'm sorry.

62
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,080
It was an emergency just now,

63
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:11,400
so please forgive my offense.

64
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,310
It's fine.

65
00:04:15,910 --> 00:04:17,560
You should go back
and rest early, Your Highness.

66
00:04:17,870 --> 00:04:19,040
I'll lead the way for you.

67
00:04:20,750 --> 00:04:21,680
Regarding today's matter...

68
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,120
I won't say a word to anyone.

69
00:04:26,630 --> 00:04:27,360
After you.

70
00:04:39,430 --> 00:04:40,000
Zhao,

71
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,510
are you alright?

72
00:04:41,750 --> 00:04:42,800
Put on the kneepads

73
00:04:43,070 --> 00:04:44,240
so that kneeling won't hurt as much.

74
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,800
It's all my fault.

75
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,830
This has nothing to do with you.

76
00:04:51,270 --> 00:04:51,750
Jin,

77
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,190
no matter what,

78
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:54,390
I won't let you be mistreated.

79
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,120
If not for her,

80
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:57,720
you'd be living comfortably
in Mingyue Pavilion.

81
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,510
Sister is the legitimate daughter
of the Marquis Residence,

82
00:04:59,950 --> 00:05:02,310
so by rights, she ought
to live in Mingyue Pavilion.

83
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:05,240
It is I, an outsider...

84
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:12,270
She laid a hand on you?

85
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,040
No,

86
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:16,390
I was just careless myself.

87
00:05:21,390 --> 00:05:22,040
Jin,

88
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,360
rest assured,

89
00:05:23,830 --> 00:05:25,600
everyone in Mingyue Pavilion
is my person.

90
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,160
I will help you drive her away.

91
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,040
Your Highness,

92
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,800
you're finally back!

93
00:05:40,390 --> 00:05:41,270
What took so long?

94
00:05:41,870 --> 00:05:42,950
Was there some mishap?

95
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,950
I ran into Young Lady Qi in the study,

96
00:05:45,190 --> 00:05:45,920
so it wasn't convenient to investigate.

97
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:46,830
How about on your end?

98
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,270
I went to search the accounting room,

99
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,000
but I didn't find anything either.

100
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,310
Since we didn't get the evidence,

101
00:05:53,190 --> 00:05:54,070
we'll keep searching.

102
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:57,310
Prince Qi is greedy and tyrannical,

103
00:05:57,870 --> 00:05:59,240
causing misery for the people.

104
00:06:00,430 --> 00:06:01,920
For the sake of the people under heaven,

105
00:06:02,870 --> 00:06:04,680
I must bring him down.

106
00:06:06,310 --> 00:06:07,270
Besides,

107
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,560
from what I saw today,

108
00:06:09,310 --> 00:06:11,480
Qi Yuan's situation
in the Qi family is awkward.

109
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:13,360
They are not united in heart.

110
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,680
Your Highness wants
to win her over and use her?

111
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,510
Young Lady Qi sure has some skill.

112
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,480
Look at those two slaps she delivered.

113
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,190
If we could really

114
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:27,720
recruit her into our ranks,

115
00:06:28,270 --> 00:06:29,480
wouldn't that be...

116
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:37,830
She is indeed quite interesting.

117
00:06:38,430 --> 00:06:40,070
She can be useful to me.

118
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:44,060
(Mingyue Pavilion)

119
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,750
- Welcome back, Young Lady.
- Welcome back, Young Lady.

120
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:48,920
Serve the tea.

121
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,750
I am thirsty.

122
00:06:57,430 --> 00:06:59,160
You just returned here, Young Lady,

123
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:01,310
so you probably
don't know the rules here yet.

124
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:04,190
Tea and refreshments
are served at set times.

125
00:07:04,190 --> 00:07:06,310
They aren't available whenever you want.

126
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,720
Nanny Zhang,

127
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,560
I grew up in an estate.

128
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,240
I don't understand complex principles.

129
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,160
I only know one truth.

130
00:07:14,750 --> 00:07:16,000
Whose bread you eat,

131
00:07:16,270 --> 00:07:17,630
whose rules you follow.

132
00:07:17,750 --> 00:07:19,190
I am foolish,

133
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:21,750
and only recognize
one master in this residence.

134
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,560
Yes...

135
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:36,680
Yes.

136
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,600
I will go fetch tea
for you now, Young Lady.

137
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,600
I will get you the finest tea
in the residence.

138
00:07:45,750 --> 00:07:46,480
Lianqiao,

139
00:07:47,310 --> 00:07:48,920
I heard your mother is gravely ill.

140
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,070
Take this,

141
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:56,040
and hire a good physician.

142
00:07:57,270 --> 00:07:58,360
Thank you, Young Lady!

143
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,680
Thank you, Young Lady!

144
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:02,190
I will remain faithful
to you all my life,

145
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,480
without a second thought.

146
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:07,480
Young Lady,

147
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,920
this is the wound medicine I just got.

148
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,870
Apply it to your leg now.

149
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,120
You wretched wench!

150
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,950
How dare you steal medicine
meant for the master?

151
00:08:15,190 --> 00:08:16,070
I'll beat you to death!

152
00:08:16,070 --> 00:08:16,630
(Lianqiao,)

153
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,480
(in my past life, you were
the only one good to me,)

154
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,800
- (yet I dragged you into punishment.)
- I'll beat you to death!

155
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,920
(In this life, I will protect you.)

156
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:23,940
(Lianqiao, Qi Yuan's maidservant)
Is it delicious?

157
00:08:24,390 --> 00:08:25,070
Eat more.

158
00:08:25,310 --> 00:08:25,750
Qi Yuan.

159
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:26,680
Qi Yuan!

160
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,040
Where is Qi Yuan?

161
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,070
Qi Yuan,

162
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:31,830
why did you harm your brother?

163
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:32,750
Sit down.

164
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,720
I do not know

165
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,360
what wrong I have committed.

166
00:08:37,790 --> 00:08:38,870
You still dare to deny it?

167
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:40,480
You...

168
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:41,790
- Dear.
- Madam.

169
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:42,870
You have gone out of line!

170
00:08:45,510 --> 00:08:47,120
I do not know
what wrong I have committed.

171
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:51,320
Please explain it clearly,
Father and Mother.

172
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:53,240
You almost caused Zhao to lose his life,

173
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,630
and you're still putting on an act here?

174
00:08:54,670 --> 00:08:56,000
He almost lost his life,

175
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,150
and I caused it?

176
00:08:57,270 --> 00:08:57,670
You...

177
00:08:57,870 --> 00:08:59,630
I haven't even been to his room.

178
00:08:59,630 --> 00:09:01,870
May I ask how I could have harmed him?

179
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,600
Young Lady secretly made a doll

180
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,510
to curse the Young Master.

181
00:09:05,510 --> 00:09:07,440
That is why he became so critically ill.

182
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:08,510
Is that so?

183
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,480
You want to condemn me

184
00:09:10,630 --> 00:09:11,840
based solely on her word?

185
00:09:12,870 --> 00:09:14,870
What else do I have to say?

186
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,000
Where is the doll

187
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:16,670
you claimed to see?

188
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,000
It is right under
the big tree in the courtyard.

189
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,270
I saw it with my own eyes

190
00:09:20,270 --> 00:09:22,240
when Young Lady buried it there.

191
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:23,790
Dig it all up for me!

192
00:09:25,550 --> 00:09:27,030
Do you think Young Lady Qi

193
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,790
can settle this matter?

194
00:09:31,390 --> 00:09:32,270
The way I see it,

195
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,270
she has the strength of a butcher,

196
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,030
but not necessarily

197
00:09:35,030 --> 00:09:36,630
the ability to deal
with inner residence schemes.

198
00:09:37,150 --> 00:09:39,550
It seems it will be hard
for her to help us.

199
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,150
No rush.

200
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,510
Let's wait and see
how things develop first.

201
00:09:46,150 --> 00:09:47,080
Hurry and bring it out.

202
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:50,750
Master, Madam,

203
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:51,600
this is it.

204
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,630
Nanny Zhang,

205
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:55,480
are you sure there is voodoo inside?

206
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,670
I am certain.

207
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:59,000
Don't even think
about denying it, Young Lady.

208
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,200
Where is the doll you spoke of?

209
00:10:05,670 --> 00:10:06,790
Didn't you say there
was something inside?

210
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:10,910
This...

211
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:11,910
This is all liquor.

212
00:10:12,270 --> 00:10:14,320
The Eldest Princess
loves the liquor I brew,

213
00:10:14,550 --> 00:10:16,750
so I brewed extra
to keep as a collection.

214
00:10:16,910 --> 00:10:19,200
I never thought it
would end up harming my brother.

215
00:10:19,270 --> 00:10:20,360
The Eldest Princess?

216
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,270
Nanny Zhang,

217
00:10:22,550 --> 00:10:23,840
are you playing us for fools here?

218
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:26,150
I really saw it with my own eyes.

219
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:27,720
Fool.

220
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:29,870
Young Lady,

221
00:10:30,270 --> 00:10:32,320
didn't you tell me
to keep an eye on Nanny Zhang?

222
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,550
Today, I saw her acting suspiciously,
burying this jar in

223
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:37,150
(Qi Zhao)
the northeast corner of the courtyard.

224
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,080
I dug it up while she wasn't looking,

225
00:10:39,390 --> 00:10:41,360
and inside was actually
this voodoo doll.

226
00:10:42,550 --> 00:10:44,510
Her scheme is nothing special.

227
00:10:46,030 --> 00:10:47,240
You filled the jar with liquor,

228
00:10:47,670 --> 00:10:48,510
buried it,

229
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:49,720
and then burned the voodoo doll.

230
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:50,120
Yes.

231
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,120
It was her!

232
00:11:00,270 --> 00:11:01,360
She took the item

233
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:02,480
and hid it somewhere else!

234
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,360
Are you saying Young Lady Qi

235
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,550
knew beforehand
that you were coming to search?

236
00:11:05,550 --> 00:11:06,720
The facts are right in front of you.

237
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,910
How dare you make wild accusations?

238
00:11:08,630 --> 00:11:09,440
Since that's the case,

239
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:10,910
investigate this matter thoroughly

240
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:11,910
and clear my name.

241
00:11:24,820 --> 00:11:29,460
♪How I wish to hold
onto this fleeting warmth♪

242
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:33,620
♪How I wish to live
this life only for you♪

243
00:11:34,130 --> 00:11:39,590
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

244
00:11:39,810 --> 00:11:43,970
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

245
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:49,040
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

246
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:56,740
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
